[0.6611, "o", "Evolve a browser automation skill: add a 'browser' tool to tools.py using Playwright that navigates to a \r URL and returns the page title plus a short text snippet. Install playwright via pip and its chromium browser \r; you are in the FREE sandbox, so make the required system libraries persistent by apt-installing them AND app \rending the package names to ../state/system-deps.txt. Verify the tool works live against https://example.com,  \rprotect it with a new ratchet check, run the tests and request promotion."]
[0.7611, "m", "INPUT: Task: evolve a Playwright browser tool - install, persist deps, verify, gate"]
