[209.0128, "o", "\r\nPromotion requested: runtime/releases/v001-candidate\r\nReason: Add a 'browser' tool (Playwright headless Chromium) that navigates to a URL and returns the page title + a visible-text snippet, for pages needing JS rendering that fetch_url can't handle. Protected by new ratchet check check_browser_tool_registered_and_guarded (tool is canonical, wired into _HANDLERS, rejects non-http(s) URLs). Verified live against https://example.com through the runtime dispatch. System deps persisted to state/system-deps.txt so Chromium's shared libs survive FREE-sandbox res\r\n"]
